✅ Practical 4: Facebook Metrics Dataset Operations
🎯 Aim:
To perform data manipulation using Python (Pandas).
🧠 Concept:
We use Pandas for handling structured data.
------------------------------------------------------
a) Create Data Subsets

import pandas as pd

df = pd.read_csv("facebook.csv")

subset = df[['like', 'share', 'comment']]
print(subset.head())
------------------------------------------------------
b) Merge Data

df1 = df[['post_id', 'like']]
df2 = df[['post_id', 'share']]

merged = pd.merge(df1, df2, on='post_id')
print(merged.head())
------------------------------------------------------
c) Sort Data
sorted_df = df.sort_values(by='like', ascending=False)
print(sorted_df.head())
------------------------------------------------------
d) Transpose Data
print(df.T)
------------------------------------------------------
e) Shape & Reshape
print(df.shape)   # rows, columns

reshaped = df.values.reshape(-1, 1)
print(reshaped[:5])
------------------------------------------------------
